Package: suborno-ime
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Native Bangla input method — portable core and command-line tools
 Suborno is a Bengali (Bangla) input method engine written in C++20.
 This package ships the portable command-line tools and libraries: the
 phonetic (Suborno/Classic/Smart), Probhat, Khipro and national keyboard
 layouts, candidate ranking, spell correction and a SQLite-backed personal
 dictionary.
 .
 The Windows text-services integration (TSF DLL and installer) is built
 separately and is not part of this package.

Package: suborno-ime-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: suborno-ime (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development headers for the Suborno IME portable core
 Public C++20 headers and the C API (libsuborno/suborno.h) needed to embed
 the Suborno engine in other applications.
